config SOC_RAPUYAMA_VIDEOCORE
	tristate "Nokia RapuYama VideoCore transport scaffold"
	depends on ARCH_RAPUYAMA && OF
	help
	  Build the platform-driver scaffold for the Nokia RapuYama BCM2727
	  VideoCore transport. The bootstrap and MeSSI/VCHI protocol are not
	  implemented yet; the driver does not access hardware registers.

	  This option is not enabled by default. If unsure, say N.
